    "Every group, expense, payment and its history, your profile and your sign-in are removed from this phone. This can't be undone. Export first if you want a copy.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "প্রতিটি গ্রুপ, খরচ, পেমেন্ট ও তার ইতিহাস, আপনার প্রোফাইল ও সাইন ইন এই ফোন থেকে মুছে যাবে। এটা ফেরানো যাবে না। কপি চাইলে আগে এক্সপোর্ট করুন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every group, expense, payment and its history, your profile and your sign-in are removed from this phone. This can't be undone. Export first if you want a copy."
          }
        }
      }
    },
