      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "এই ফোনের গ্রুপগুলো যেমন আছে তেমনই থাকবে। অ্যাকাউন্ট দিয়ে নতুন ফোনে আবার সাইন ইন করতে পারবেন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your groups on this phone stay as they are. The account lets you sign in again on a new phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in with the method you used when you made your account.": {
      "comment": "Bengali drafted by Claude; needs native review before release.",
      "localizations": {
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "অ্যাকাউন্ট খোলার সময় যে উপায় ব্যবহার করেছিলেন, সেটি দিয়ে সাইন ইন করুন।"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in with the method you used when you made your account."
